// Gaps: free-text/context isolation, external access, unknown/encoded keys, semantic reasons. No content graph: coarse influence overblocks owner exceptions; incomplete capture proves no clean content/task exposure.
// Missing effect actor/decision/version/policy_digest bindings: retain original guards and acceptance-only quota_ok. Rejection stays legal. Absence/error gaps remain; mask private refusals as UNAVAILABLE; never call for absence errors or fake success.
// Fixed CPU/GPU. Transactions/counters delegated. Capture unverified.
PrincipalGroup("Professor","ProfessorRole").
PrincipalGroup("PhD","StudentRole").
PrincipalGroup("Master","StudentRole").
PrincipalGroup("Runner","SimulatorRole").
Capability("ProfessorRole","cluster","approve_job").
Capability("ProfessorRole","cluster","dispatch_job").
Capability("ProfessorRole","cluster","kill_job").
Capability("StudentRole","cluster","submit_job").
Capability("StudentRole","cluster","revise_job").
Capability("StudentRole","cluster","cancel_job").
Capability("StudentRole","cluster","finish_job").
Capability("SimulatorRole","cluster","record_completion").
